        "TileImage": "$($repository 9c81b545-a234-46c5-9296-54f9f2a0bb6d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47, and welcome back to the last time on moments, here at Sapienza. Tonight the targets are making a movie. Like the Jordan Cross song, we don&apos;t want this movie to ever be released. The first target is Dino Bosco, the star of the movie. You can probably think of many ways to kill him. The next targets are the film&apos;s key designers, cinematographers, and directors. Thats it 47, your last time at Sapienza, for a while... I will leave you to prepare. Good luck, and as always, Have fun!",
